+defines an isomorphism phi by the exact biconditional uv in E(G) iff
+phi(u)phi(v) in E(G'). Definition 3 fixes tree decompositions and tree width.
+Theorem 1 rules out Track A: it tests isomorphism in
+2^(k polylog k) poly(N). Theorem 2 also canonizes in
