+Mechanical and compact routes. The reference route treats the descriptions as
+graphs: materialize every successor, locate the hub fixed point, traverse
+a whole cycle, and check the induced bijection. Its operation and wall-clock
+cost are measured at the shipping preset. The compact route notices that A and
+B are conjugate parabolic projectivities, obtains their double fixed points,
+and fits the unique projectivity through three corresponding points. It is
+also executed in selftest and its exact-operation counter must stay below 300.
 
