codex
The implementation and local evidence are now internally consistent. The final module passes the corrected structure-aware G4, all nine local gates, independent explicit edge-set equivalence tests, JSON/transcript schema checks, hint-mode checks, and escalation-to-`cap_bound` checks.

The only unmet requirement is external: all bare, structural-hint, and placebo harness calls were rejected at the account boundary with HTTP 403 before a model answered. Accordingly, the README labels the preset a shipping candidate rather than claiming a hardened result, and the transcripts preserve the failure instead of fabricating a verdict.
